  "descriptionHtml": "<p>ضمان عام من الوكيل</p><p><br></p><p><span>Key Technical Specifications</span></p><div jsaction=\"rcuQ6b:&amp;UBG4We_i|npT2md\" jscontroller=\"zcfIf\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_i\">Based on official specifications and retailer data, the keyboard includes:</div><ul jscontroller=\"mPWODf\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_j\"><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_k\"><span jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_l\"><span jscontroller=\"zYmgkd\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_m\">Switch Type:</span>&nbsp;Linear Outemu Mechanical Red Switches, offering quiet and fast keystrokes with a lifespan of 50 million clicks.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_n\"><span jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_o\"><span jscontroller=\"zYmgkd\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_p\">Form Factor:</span>&nbsp;Compact&nbsp;<span jscontroller=\"zYmgkd\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_q\">87-key</span>&nbsp;layout (TKL) built with a highly durable Metal and ABS plastic frame.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_r\"><span jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_s\"><span jscontroller=\"zYmgkd\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_t\">Lighting:</span>&nbsp;<span jscontroller=\"zYmgkd\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_u\">Rainbow RGB LED</span>&nbsp;backlight with 19 different lighting modes and 6 colors; brightness and speed are adjustable directly from the keyboard.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_v\"><span jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_w\"><span jscontroller=\"zYmgkd\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_x\">Connectivity:</span>&nbsp;Wired via a 1.8m braided USB cable with a gold-plated connector for high-speed response.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_y\"><span jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_z\"><span jscontroller=\"zYmgkd\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_10\">Keycaps:</span>&nbsp;Double-shot injection molded keycaps that ensure characters never wear off while allowing clear backlighting.</span></li></ul><div jsaction=\"rcuQ6b:&amp;UBG4We_11|npT2md\" jscontroller=\"KHhJQ\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_11\"></div><div aria-level=\"3\" role=\"heading\" jscontroller=\"a7qCn\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_12\"><span jscontroller=\"zYmgkd\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_13\">Performance &amp; Extra Features</span></div><ul jscontroller=\"mPWODf\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_14\"><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_15\"><span jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_16\"><span jscontroller=\"zYmgkd\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_17\">Anti-Ghosting:</span>&nbsp;Supports Full N-Key Rollover to ensure every keypress is registered even when multiple keys are hit simultaneously.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_18\"><span jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_19\"><span jscontroller=\"zYmgkd\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_1a\">Durability:</span>&nbsp;The structure is&nbsp;<span jscontroller=\"zYmgkd\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_1b\">Splash-proof</span>, designed to withstand minor liquid spills.</span></li><li jscontroller=\"vsuOFb\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_1c\"><span jscontroller=\"fly6D\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_1d\" aria-owns=\"action-menu-parent-container\"><span jscontroller=\"zYmgkd\" jsuid=\"UBG4We_1e\">Compatibility:</span>&nbsp;Fully compatible with Windows (11/10/8/7), with limited support for macOS.</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://turbo-computer.com/image/catalog/accessories/K552wglr4_.jpg\"><img src=\"https://turbo-computer.com/image/catalog/accessories/K552wglr3_.jpg\"><br></p><div class=\"",
